    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/style.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body>

    <header class="site-header">
        <nav class="nav" id="mainNav">
            <a href="index" class="brand">
                <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M15 5h10v6l4 5v17a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H14a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V16l4-5V5Z" fill="var(--leaf)" /><path d="M12 20h16v11a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H15a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V20Z" fill="var(--gold)" /></svg>
                Dudh<span class="dahi">Dahi</span>
            </a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="index">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="products">Products</a></li>
                <li><a href="about" aria-current="page">Our Farm</a></li>
                <li><a href="contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="nav-actions">
                <a href="contact" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Get in touch</a>
                <button class="cart-btn" id="cartToggle" aria-label="Open cart">
                    <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--leaf-deep)" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 4h2l2.4 12.4a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h8.2a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.6L21 8H6" /><circle cx="10" cy="21" r="1.4" /><circle cx="18" cy="21" r="1.4" /></svg>
                    <span class="cart-count">0</span>
                </button>
                <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Toggle menu"><span></span></button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="page-hero">
        <span class="eyebrow">Since 2016</span>
        <h1>We didn't set out to build a brand.<br>Just a shorter road to your kitchen.</h1>
    </div>

    <section class="section section-tight">
        <div class="split">
            <div data-reveal>
                <span class="eyebrow">The problem we saw</span>
                <h2>Milk was travelling further than it should.</h2>
                <p class="lede">By the time packaged milk reached most kitchens, it had passed through three or four hands and picked up additives to survive the journey. Small farmers, meanwhile, were paid a fraction of what their milk was worth.</p>
                <ul class="checklist">
                    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> We collect directly from 120+ partner farms every dawn</li>
                    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> Farmers are paid within 24 hours, above market rate</li>
                    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> Products reach your door in under three hours from processing</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="split-media" data-reveal>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 480 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <rect width="480" height="400" rx="28" fill="var(--cream-card)" />
                    <ellipse cx="240" cy="330" rx="150" ry="18" fill="var(--leaf-deep)" opacity="0.08" />
                    <ellipse cx="230" cy="230" rx="95" ry="60" fill="var(--leaf)" />
                    <ellipse cx="150" cy="205" rx="34" ry="30" fill="var(--leaf)" />
                    <circle cx="140" cy="195" r="6" fill="var(--bg)" />
                    <path d="M118 175c-6-10-4-20 4-24 2 10 2 18-4 24Z" fill="var(--clay)" />
                    <path d="M170 175c6-10 4-20-4-24-2 10-2 18 4 24Z" fill="var(--clay)" />
                    <rect x="190" y="275" width="14" height="40" rx="6" fill="var(--leaf)" />
                    <rect x="230" y="280" width="14" height="35" rx="6" fill="var(--leaf)" />
                    <rect x="270" y="275" width="14" height="40" rx="6" fill="var(--leaf)" />
                    <rect x="305" y="280" width="14" height="35" rx="6" fill="var(--leaf)" />
                    <circle cx="200" cy="235" r="7" fill="var(--gold-soft)" />
                    <circle cx="225" cy="248" r="7" fill="var(--gold-soft)" />
                    <circle cx="255" cy="232" r="7" fill="var(--gold-soft)" />
                    <circle cx="280" cy="250" r="7" fill="var(--gold-soft)" />
                    <circle cx="380" cy="90" r="30" fill="var(--gold)" opacity="0.85" />
                </svg>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
            <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">How it moves</span>
                <h2>Udder to doorstep, in four steps.</h2>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process">
            <div class="process-step" data-reveal>
                <div class="process-num">01</div>
                <h3>4:00 AM — Collected</h3>
                <p>Farmers hand-milk and chill within minutes; our van does the rounds before sunrise.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="process-step" data-reveal>
                <div class="process-num">02</div>
                <h3>5:30 AM — Tested</h3>
                <p>Every batch is checked for purity, fat content and freshness before it's accepted.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="process-step" data-reveal>
                <div class="process-num">03</div>
                <h3>6:00 AM — Prepared</h3>
                <p>Milk is packed; dahi is set overnight; ghee is slow-churned in small batches.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="process-step" data-reveal>
                <div class="process-num">04</div>
                <h3>7:00 AM — Delivered</h3>
                <p>Cold-chain vans complete every route before most kitchens have boiled their first cup.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <svg class="footer-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 30c240 30 480-30 720 0s480 30 720 0v30H0Z" fill="var(--bg)" /></svg>
        <div class="footer-grid">
            <div>
                <div class="footer-brand">
                    <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path d="M15 5h10v6l4 5v17a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H14a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V16l4-5V5Z" fill="var(--gold)" /></svg>
                    Dudh<span style="color:var(--gold-soft)">Dahi</span>
                </div>
                <p>Farm-fresh dairy, collected at dawn and delivered before breakfast — across Gurugram and Delhi NCR.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>Explore</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="products">All products</a></li>
                    <li><a href="about">Our farm story</a></li>
                    <li><a href="contact">Subscriptions</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>Categories</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="products">Milk</a></li>
                    <li><a href="products">Dahi &amp; Curd</a></li>
                    <li><a href="products">Ghee</a></li>
                    <li><a href="products">Chaas &amp; Cream</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>Get in touch</h4>
                <p>hello@dudhdahi.in<br>+91 98765 43210<br>Sector 14, Gurugram, Haryana</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <span>© 2026 DudhDahi. All rights reserved.</span>
            <span>Made with care for small dairy farms.</span>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <div class="cart-overlay" id="cartOverlay"></div>
    <aside class="cart-drawer" id="cartDrawer" aria-label="Shopping cart">
        <div class="cart-head">
            <h3>Your basket</h3>
            <button class="cart-close" id="cartClose" aria-label="Close cart">✕</button>
        </div>
        <div class="cart-items" id="cartItems"></div>
        <div class="cart-foot">
            <div class="cart-total"><span>Total</span><span id="cartTotal">₹0</span></div>
            <a href="contact" class="btn btn-primary">Checkout via WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

    <script src="~/js/script.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
</body>
</html>